    "detailed_description": "<h1>GameCup 2023</h1><p><strong>Will</strong> is the winner of <strong>GameCup 2023</strong>, BOSS category<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504580/extras/ef13998e57c12ff88c423824907496e9.avif?t=1718127194\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I'm Will, your avatar in this escape room.</h2><br><br><strong><i>...Initialization...</i></strong><br><br>Imagine waking up every day in the same confined flat that you apparently can't get out of, without knowing how or why you are there. <br>A few moments of exploration remind you that this is your home, and lead you to the fixed computer, presumably yours, although you have to carry out a number of twisted little operations to get everything to work properly, in the midst of the ambient muddle of convoluted searches that you've lost track of. <br><br>The tasks repeat themselves: wake up, a cup of coffee, power on the computer, update the software, start working... <br>What do you mean it doesn't suit you? Would you... leave? You would like to... change the script...? Hang on, what are you doing, hang on...!<br><br><strong><i>//<strong>Will.exe</strong> encountered an error. Restart in progress...//</i></strong><br><br><strong><i>...Initialization... </i></strong><br><br><strong>Will.exe</strong> is not a typical escape room. The levels evolve... The artistic direction reflects the gameplay, which... <br><br><strong><i>//<strong>Will.exe</strong> encountered an error. Restart in progress...//</i></strong><br><br><strong><i>...Initialization...</i></strong>",
